{"id":"cb58718fcb0cc76b","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-representable-predicate.md","title":"Representable Predicate","display":"df-representable-predicate — Representable Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-representable-predicate","aliases":["57-df-representable-predicate"],"display":"df-representable-predicate — Representable Predicate","depends_on":["[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]","[[57-df-numeral]]","[[57-df-representable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-representable-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-representable-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-representable-predicate — Representable Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd1d3a421d8f589e\" href=\"?note=cd1d3a421d8f589e\" title=\"57-df-robinson-arithmetic\">57-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4744f89052b0cbdb\" href=\"?note=4744f89052b0cbdb\" title=\"57-df-representable\">57-df-representable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Arithmetically-Representable-Predicates\">Arithmetically Representable Predicates</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^n\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\)</span> 为互异变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cd1d3a421d8f589e\" href=\"?note=cd1d3a421d8f589e\" title=\"57-df-robinson-arithmetic\">57-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> 的句子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a> 的标准一阶 Hilbert 可推导关系；数码与同时代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4744f89052b0cbdb\" href=\"?note=4744f89052b0cbdb\" title=\"57-df-representable\">57-df-representable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_P\">\\(\\varphi_P\\)</span> 仅在选定一个表示公式后使用，不假设每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 都已有这样的公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RepWitness}_Q(P,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\n\\land\\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;(\\vec a\\in P\\leftrightarrow Q\\vdash\\varphi[\\underline{\\vec a}/\\vec x]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RepWitness}_Q(P,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\n\\land\\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;(\\vec a\\in P\\leftrightarrow Q\\vdash\\varphi[\\underline{\\vec a}/\\vec x]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepPred}_n\\coloneqq\\{P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^n:\\exists\\varphi\\;\\operatorname{RepWitness}_Q(P,\\varphi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RepPred}_n\\coloneqq\\{P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^n:\\exists\\varphi\\;\\operatorname{RepWitness}_Q(P,\\varphi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RepWitness}_Q(P,\\varphi_P)\\to P\\in\\mathrm{RepPred}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RepWitness}_Q(P,\\varphi_P)\\to P\\in\\mathrm{RepPred}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可表示性是存在表示公式的性质，而不是对一个未指定的 φ_P 的无条件断言；不添加否定式可证性到原谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Arithmetically-Representable-Predicates","text":"Arithmetically Representable Predicates","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-S-ar","status":"resolved","id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-S-ar]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"cd1d3a421d8f589e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-hilbert-derivable","status":"resolved","id":"52897755c29c065c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-